	<!-- v0.6.0: Inter (SIL OFL, bundled, Media/Fonts/Inter-OFL.txt), the
		default body font. Same fallbacks as above. Inter is wider than Arial
		Narrow, so each size is a point smaller (11 stays 11: nothing under 11).
		Settings → Display → Font switches back to Arial Narrow. -->
